{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37249","headline":"上元夜建元寺观灯呈智通上人 · 章谒","name":"上元夜建元寺观灯呈智通上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建元看别上元灯，处处回廊鬬火层。\n珠玉乱抛高殿佛，绮罗深拜远山僧。\n临风走笔思呈惠，到晓行禅合伴能。\n无限喧阗留不得，月华西下露华凝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}